        "raw": "<p>We had an amazingly close game tonight. Seriously, it&#39;s as close as you can get to losing: game was won with Redeemer Fanatic and Frozen AZ incapacitated and Golem Unity at 1 hp (and Champion Bot as her only companion with 1 hp). We were up against Advanced Baron Blade in Megalopolis. It was insane! At the end, Blade was packing 2 Backlash Fields, the Turret, and a Living Force Field (so he had -2 DR, as Advanced mode gave him -1 to start).</p><p>Great fun, though. I&#39;ve had some close calls, but that was the closest. We were able to keep Unity floating at 1 hp for 2 rounds, protecting her with Bots to soak damage (she purposefully retrieved and played Stealth Bot to soak damage) while AZ kept the environment locked down with his incapacitated ability.</p><p>The game was such a killer because we couldn&#39;t get a Fueled Freeze or Bee Bot earlier to deal with the Backlashes and Force Field. Frustrating, but hilarious when it came down to the wire.</p><p>(And when we flipped him, he had 13 cards in the trash. Fanatic had to plow him for a 20 hp Wrathful Retribution to keep him from winning the next turn.)</p>",
